    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fashion game where your unique, cute style comes to life!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the latest fashion trends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a new model, enjoy fashion, work, and sometimes romance, while aiming to become a top model!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own cute model with trendy fashion items!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up freely with trendy items approved by the popular  Japanese fashion magazine 'Nicola'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them with trendy hair and makeup to enjoy being stylish just like in real life!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the dream job of being a model!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on various jobs like magazines, TV shows, and fashion shows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In magazine work, experience everything from putting together outfits based on themes, to photo shoots and article layouts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the perfect article where your outfit shines the most!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friendships and romance too! Your unique story of growth awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet many unique model friends and boys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, go out together, and experience the glamorous life of a model!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fashion game where your unique, cute style comes to life!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the latest fashion trends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a new model, enjoy fashion, work, and sometimes romance, while aiming to become a top model!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own cute model with trendy fashion items!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up freely with trendy items approved by the popular  Japanese fashion magazine 'Nicola'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them with trendy hair and makeup to enjoy being stylish just like in real life!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the dream job of being a model!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on various jobs like magazines, TV shows, and fashion shows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In magazine work, experience everything from putting together outfits based on themes, to photo shoots and article layouts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the perfect article where your outfit shines the most!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friendships and romance too! Your unique story of growth awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet many unique model friends and boys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, go out together, and experience the glamorous life of a model!</p>",
